016 and ISO 9001 certifications"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Berlin, Connecticut -> db", "Formerly OKAY Industries -> homepage", "Over 100 years engineering/manufacturing expertise -> homepage", "Nearly 50 years serving medtech -> homepage", "Three locations USA and Costa Rica, 226,000+ sq ft -> capabilities page", "Capabilities list (stamping, Swiss turning, laser, tube forming, injection molding, assembly, etc.) -> capabilities page", "NexTech Labs for prototyping -> homepage, capabilities page", "LaserWorks R&D lab -> capabilities page", "Industries served: cardiac/neurostimulator implants, laparoscopic/endoscopic/arthroscopic, surgical stapling/cutting, ENT blades, ligation instruments -> homepage", "Automotive cold-rolled part case study -> homepage, capabilities page", "ISO 13485:2016 US and Costa Rica -> quality page", "ISO 9001 certification -> capabilities page", "Quality equipment: Optical Inspection, CMMs, Mechanical Testing, SPC, ERP, Traceability -> quality page", "Materials: Titanium (Titanium Stamping, Titanium Prototype), Cold rolled steel (Automotive case study) -> homepage, capabilities page", "Design for Manufacturability and Design for Automation -> capabilities page", "Spanish language option -> homepage, capabilities page", "LinkedIn and Facebook icons in footer -> homepage, capabilities page"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "AVNA (formerly OKAY Industries) is a partner Medical Device OEMs can rely on for their precision powered, robotic and mechanical device applications", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": ["Spanish"], "social_links": [], "ownership_tags": []}'::jsonb, updated_at=now() WHERE slug='avna-formerly-okay-industries-berlin-ct' AND approved AND profile IS NULL;
