UPDATE companies SET description='Abingdon Spares was founded in 1968 in Needham, Massachusetts, by Jerry Goguen, a sports-car enthusiast who also established the Westminster MG Car Museum in Vermont. The business began as a specialist supplier for MG T-series (TC, TD, TF) models.

